WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.840
过来？好呀。亲一口。
Come here? Okay. One kiss.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.010
现在，拖鞋。等咪一下。
Now, slippers. Wait for Mii.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.850
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.840
你：蹲下摸摸咪的头夸它
You: Crouch down and pat Mi's head to praise it.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.920
好吗？咪做对了。
Good? Mii did it right.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.450
拖鞋准备好了。咪早就知道。
Slippers ready. Mii knew.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.150
接下来是早饭。不许偷看。
Next, breakfast. Don't peek.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:10.440
你：我就偷看一眼，你在做什么呀？
You: I'm just taking a peek. What are you doing?

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:15.740
嘿！不许偷看。这是惊喜。
Hey! No peeking. It's a surprise.

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.500
好啦。你可以看一点点。
Okay. You can look. A little.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.640
咪在工作。很认真。
Mii is working. Very serious.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.040
你：你是不是想偷吃果酱呀？
You: Were you trying to sneak some jam?

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.660
不是！咪只是在检查。
No! Mii is just checking.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:46.420
咪来抹，好好地抹。
I will spread it. Properly.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.700
不是故意的。这是艺术。
Not on purpose. It's art.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.640
你：夸爪印很可爱，咬一口
You: Say the paw print is so cute, then take a bite.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.070
可爱吧？当然。是咪设计的。
Cute? Of course. Mii designed it.

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.430
嗯，甜的。
Mmm. Sweet.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:13.570
味道怎么样？说实话。
How is it? Be honest.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:18.240
你：好吃！不过你自己也尝一口嘛
You: Yummy! But you should have a bite too.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:23.080
真的吗？咪合格了？好，就吃一口。
Really? Mii passed? Okay, one bite.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:34.280
嗯。还不错。咪是好厨师。
Mmm. Not bad. Mii is a good chef.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.260
现在我们一人一口。接下来呢？
Now we share. Next, what?

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.840
你：你嘴边沾果酱啦，我帮你擦擦，别动
You: You've got jam by your mouth. Let me wipe it off, don't move.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.820
好。咪不动。胡须都不动。
Okay. Mii won't move. Not even a whisker.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:54.670
咪一动不动。很乖。
Mii is not moving. Very still.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.430
果酱快没了。咪去买新的。
Jam is almost gone. Mii will buy more.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:03.440
你：让咪出门去买果酱
You: Let Mi go out to buy jam.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.870
好。咪去买果酱。
Okay. Mii will buy the jam.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:19.000
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:26.040
你：路上小心哦，咪买完要马上回来
You: Be careful on the way. Come straight back once Mi is done shopping.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.910
好的。咪会小心。
Okay. Mii will be careful.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.050
太重了。但咪很有力气。
Heavy. But Mii is strong.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:42.530
拿到了。现在直接回家。
Got it. Now, straight home.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.640
你：你怎么付钱的呀？小钱包带了吗？
You: How did you pay? Did you bring your little wallet?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.190
钱包？当然带了。咪早就计划好了。
Wallet? Of course. Mii planned it.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:03.720
找到啦。你看，咪准备好了。
Found it. See? Mii is ready.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:08.010
一枚硬币。够了吧？
One coin. Enough, right?

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.240
你：让咪先去收银台付钱
You: Let Mi go to the register first to pay.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.110
先付钱。咪知道。
Pay first. Mii knows.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.990
一枚硬币。够了吧？
One coin. Enough, right?

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:27.730
咪付钱了。快夸我。
Mii paid. Say good job.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.840
你：咪好棒！快回家，我想吃你抹的果酱吐司
You: Good job, Mi! Let's go home, I want the jam toast you spread.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.490
被夸了！好，直接回家。
Praised! Okay. Straight home.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:49.470
到家了。咪很快吧。
Home. Mii was fast.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:53.540
新果酱。现在做新吐司。
Fresh jam. Now, a new toast.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.440
你：你抹给我看，要抹得满满的，我要吃
You: Show me how you spread it. Spread it nice and thick, I want to eat it.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.530
好的。咪给你抹得满满的。
Okay. Mii will make it full.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:10.080
咪来开盖。像专业的一样。
Mii opens it. Like a pro.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:13.600
满满的。照你说的。快吃！
Full. Like you asked. Eat!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.040
你：拿起吐司咬一大口
You: Pick up the toast and take a big bite.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:23.860
吃吧。咪抹得满满的。
Eat it. Mii made it full.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.360
嗯？好吃吗？说实话。
Mmm? Is it good? Be honest.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.580
咪想要摸摸头。
Mii wants a head pat.
